# ROADMAP MODE: PRODUCT ROADMAP MANAGEMENT PROCESS MAP

> **TL;DR:** This visual map guides the ROADMAP mode process, focusing on managing product epics/features, tracking progress across multiple tasks, and maintaining roadmap structure.

## 🧭 ROADMAP MODE PROCESS FLOW

```mermaid
graph TD
    Start["START ROADMAP MODE"] --> CheckFile["Check if<br>roadmap.md exists"]
    
    CheckFile -->|"Does not exist"| CreateFile["Create roadmap.md<br>with template structure"]
    CheckFile -->|"Exists"| ReadRoadmap["Read roadmap.md"]
    
    CreateFile --> ReadRoadmap
    
    ReadRoadmap --> DetermineOp{"Determine<br>Operation"}
    
    DetermineOp -->|"Create Epic"| CreateEpic["CREATE EPIC/FEATURE"]
    DetermineOp -->|"Update Status"| UpdateStatus["UPDATE STATUS"]
    DetermineOp -->|"Link Task"| LinkTask["LINK TASK"]
    DetermineOp -->|"Unlink Task"| UnlinkTask["UNLINK TASK"]
    DetermineOp -->|"View Roadmap"| ViewRoadmap["VIEW ROADMAP"]
    DetermineOp -->|"Update Progress"| UpdateProgress["UPDATE PROGRESS"]
    
    CreateEpic --> GetDetails["Get Epic Details:<br>Name, Description, Priority,<br>Target Date, Dependencies"]
    GetDetails --> GenerateID["Generate Epic ID<br>EPIC-[sequential]"]
    GenerateID --> CreateStructure["Create Epic Structure<br>with Status: Planned"]
    CreateStructure --> SaveRoadmap["Save to roadmap.md"]
    
    UpdateStatus --> SelectEpic["Select Epic/Feature"]
    SelectEpic --> GetNewStatus["Get New Status:<br>Planned | In Progress | Blocked | Completed"]
    GetNewStatus --> ValidateStatus["Validate Status<br>Transition"]
    ValidateStatus --> UpdateEpicStatus["Update Epic Status"]
    UpdateEpicStatus --> SaveRoadmap
    
    LinkTask --> SelectEpic2["Select Epic/Feature"]
    SelectEpic2 --> GetTaskID["Get Task ID<br>from tasks.md"]
    GetTaskID --> CheckTaskExists["Verify Task Exists"]
    CheckTaskExists --> AddTaskLink["Add Task to<br>Epic Linked Tasks"]
    AddTaskLink --> UpdateTaskFile["Update tasks.md<br>with Roadmap Link"]
    UpdateTaskFile --> RecalculateProgress["Recalculate Progress"]
    RecalculateProgress --> SaveRoadmap
    
    UnlinkTask --> SelectEpic3["Select Epic/Feature"]
    SelectEpic3 --> SelectTask["Select Task to Unlink"]
    SelectTask --> RemoveTaskLink["Remove Task from<br>Epic Linked Tasks"]
    RemoveTaskLink --> UpdateTaskFile2["Update tasks.md<br>remove Roadmap Link"]
    UpdateTaskFile2 --> RecalculateProgress2["Recalculate Progress"]
    RecalculateProgress2 --> SaveRoadmap
    
    ViewRoadmap --> DisplayEpics["Display All Epics/Features<br>with Status and Progress"]
    DisplayEpics --> FormatOutput["Format Roadmap View:<br>- Status Summary<br>- Progress Metrics<br>- Linked Tasks"]
    
    UpdateProgress --> ReadAllTasks["Read All Linked Tasks<br>from tasks.md"]
    ReadAllTasks --> CalculateMetrics["Calculate Progress:<br>- Completed Tasks<br>- Total Tasks<br>- Progress %"]
    CalculateMetrics --> UpdateEpicProgress["Update Epic Progress<br>Metrics"]
    UpdateEpicProgress --> CheckCompletion["Check if All Tasks<br>Complete"]
    CheckCompletion -->|"All Complete"| AutoComplete["Auto-Update Status<br>to Completed"]
    CheckCompletion -->|"Not Complete"| SaveRoadmap
    AutoComplete --> SaveRoadmap
    
    SaveRoadmap --> Complete["ROADMAP OPERATION<br>COMPLETE"]
    FormatOutput --> Complete
    
    style Start fill:#4da6ff,stroke:#0066cc,color:white
    style CreateEpic fill:#4dbb5f,stroke:#36873f,color:white
    style UpdateStatus fill:#ffa64d,stroke:#cc7a30,color:white
    style LinkTask fill:#d94dbb,stroke:#a3378a,color:white
    style ViewRoadmap fill:#4dbbbb,stroke:#368787,color:white
    style UpdateProgress fill:#d971ff,stroke:#a33bc2,color:white
    style Complete fill:#b0bec5,stroke:#90a4ae,color:white
```

