## 🔄 PROGRESS CALCULATION FLOW

```mermaid
graph TD
    StartCalc["Start Progress Calculation"] --> ReadEpic["Read Epic from<br>roadmap.md"]
    ReadEpic --> GetLinkedTasks["Get Linked Task IDs"]
    GetLinkedTasks --> ReadTasksFile["Read tasks.md<br>for Task Statuses"]
    ReadTasksFile --> CountCompleted["Count Tasks with<br>Status: COMPLETE"]
    CountCompleted --> CountTotal["Count Total<br>Linked Tasks"]
    CountTotal --> CalculatePercent["Calculate:<br>Progress % = Completed / Total"]
    CalculatePercent --> UpdateEpic["Update Epic Progress<br>in roadmap.md"]
    UpdateEpic --> CheckAllComplete{"All Tasks<br>Complete?"}
    CheckAllComplete -->|"Yes"| SetCompleted["Set Status to<br>Completed"]
    CheckAllComplete -->|"No"| Done["Calculation Complete"]
    SetCompleted --> Done
    
    style StartCalc fill:#4da6ff,stroke:#0066cc,color:white
    style CalculatePercent fill:#4dbb5f,stroke:#36873f,color:white
    style SetCompleted fill:#d94dbb,stroke:#a3378a,color:white
```

